# From "Expansion in Locale 1" (Wave VI - Odyssey, CD1-2): a lift-out
# familiarisation exercise -- the intent is explicitly to stay close to the
# physical body, in the room, not to travel far.

@segment  expansion-in-locale-1
@title    Expansion in Locale 1
@levels   F12
@duration ~4m

say Feel the vibrations of your second body, your energy body, surrounding your physical one. Take a moment with it.
pause 8
say Now, in Focus 12, notice those vibrations rising. Pulsing faster. More and more.
pause 8
say As you relax into this, notice yourself getting lighter. Lighter still. It's a good feeling — simply floating, inside your own energy body.
pause 10
say Now think of floating upward. Up. How nice it feels, lighter and lighter, gently floating up and away from your physical body.
pause 10
say Relax into it.
pause 5
say Now, slowly and calmly, float back down. Toward your physical body. Feel the vibrations of your energy body slowing as you settle back into place.
pause 10
say Relax, and remember this freedom of movement.
pause 6
